  "slug": "pepperoncini-tuna-salad-recipe-12025705",
  "name": "Pepperoncini Tuna Salad",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "Add some pepperoncini to your tuna salad for a zingy lunch or snack. With a Greek yogurt-mayonnaise dressing, crumbled feta, and lemon juice, this tuna salad is piquant and satisfying.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Stir tuna, pepperoncini, brine, red onion, parsley, feta, lemon juice, Greek yogurt, balsamic vinegar, mayonnaise, dill, salt, and pepper together in a bowl until well combined. Cover and refrigerate at least 30 minutes or until ready to serve."
    }
  ],
